Ludwig runs happily around in the forest.
Suddenly he sees a big bird.
He runs quickly after it.
He runs all the way over towards the trees.
"Stop, Ludwig!" I shout loudly.
"Come over here!"
But he ignores me completely.
I must not just yell at him.
Because it does not work at all.
I take a small treat out of my pocket instead.
I crouch down in the grass.
"Ludwig, look here," I call softly.
He stops and looks at me.
He really wants the treat.
He runs quickly back to me.
"Sit," I say calmly.
He sits down, and I give it to him.
"Good dog," I say and pet him.
I clip the leash onto him again.
Now we must go home and relax.
